"txt_gcheckout_setup_note";s:1824:"To set up your Google Checkout module, please adjust the fields below. You should obtain your Merchant ID and Merchant key values from your Google Checkout account. Choose 'Test mode' if you are going to use a Sandbox account. Choose 'Live mode' if you are going to use your production account.<br /><br />
